SaffronCity_Text_BaldingMan::
	.string "You came out from JOHTO?\p"
	.string "You can zip back home if the MAGNET\n"
	.string "TRAIN’s running.$"

SaffronCity_Text_CrushGirl::
	.string "This is SILPH CO., famous for\n"
	.string "POKéMON merchandise.\p"
	.string "In the past, TEAM ROCKET wanted the\n"
	.string "company because of that.$"

SaffronCity_Text_WorkerM::
	.string "There’s a place called TRAINER\n"
	.string "HOUSE in VIRIDIAN where trainers\l"
	.string "gather from all over the place.$"

SaffronCity_Text_Woman2_1::
	.string "A little girl who is an expert at\n"
	.string "mimicking people lives here.\p"
	.string "She even mimics the people she’s\n"
	.string "conversing with.\l"
	.string "It’s confusing.$"

SaffronCity_Text_Woman2_2::
	.string "The COPYCAT girl looked unhappy.\p"
	.string "She said she lost her favorite\n"
	.string "POKéDOLL--CLEFAIRY.$"

SaffronCity_Text_Boy::
	.string "Going into an alley for the\n"
	.string "first time makes me sorta anxious.$"

SaffronCity_Text_FatMan_1::
	.string "Chew... Chew...\p"
	.string "I hear there’s big trouble brewing at\n"
	.string "the POWER PLANT.\p"
	.string "Chew... Chew...$"

SaffronCity_Text_FatMan_2::
	.string "Chew... Chew...\p"
	.string "I hear there was big trouble at the\n"
	.string "POWER PLANT.\p"
	.string "Chew... Chew...\n"
	.string "Haaah, I’m full!$"

SaffronCity_Text_WorkerF::
	.string "Our city was featured on a\n"
	.string "radio program.\p"
	.string "It’s nice to hear praise for your\n"
	.string "city, but it’s a bit embarrassing\l"
	.string "too.$"

SaffronCity_Text_BlackBelt::
	.string "I went to the GYM, raging for battles\n"
	.string "against trainers...\p"
	.string "It turns out, I stumbled into the\n"
	.string "unused GYM next door.\p"
	.string "Boy, I was pretty embarrassed.$"

SaffronCity_Text_LaprasDoll::
	.string "MESSAGE FROM ZEL: I forbid you to\n"
	.string "proceed any further!\p"
	.string "And don’t move this rock or use walk\n"
	.string "through cheats.\l"
	.string "There’s nothing further anyway...$"

